            Exploring beautiful places and the stories behind them.
          </p>

          <span class="date">25 September 2026</span>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- FEATURE -->
  <section class="feature" id="stories">

    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1497366754035-f200968a6e72?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85">

    <div>

      <span class="category">Editor's Choice</span>

      <h2>Designing A Better Digital World</h2>

      <p>
        Great design is not only about appearance. It is about creating
        experiences that feel simple, useful and memorable.
      </p>

      <a href="#" class="read-btn">READ ARTICLE</a>

    </div>

  </section>


  <!-- QUOTE -->
  <section class="quote">

    <h2>
      "Classic ideas never truly go out of style."
    </h2>

    <span>— NOIR EDITORIAL</span>

  </section>


  <!-- MORE STORIES -->
  <section>

    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>More From NOIR</h2>
      <span>NOIR / 02</span>
    </div>

    <div class="cards">

      <article class="card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80">

